text:
@Angelie_Rose Thank you for staying until the very end… 🤍  
Your words truly mean more than you know.  
I'm so glad the story spoke to you.

@H@HeartEchoaimusicww you are so welcome my dear friend ❣️
It makes me happy to hear from you tonight ❣️
All your wonderful music, songs of much love and goodbyes are truly enjoyable and appreciated.  Your unmatched voice and handsome blue eyes show such tenderness that lures one into the emotions of every word you sing.  I am captivated and I can’t wait to hear you again and again ❣️.  So thank YOU for sharing your amazing and unique talent with me and many others… my ❤️ and admiration to you 🫠🤗🥰🌹

@HeartEchoaimusic
❤️U
🤗🥰

@IlseLemmert The last song carries a quiet goodbye… ❤️
Thank you for staying until the end of the album.
What part of it stayed with you the most? 🌙

@heart_eyeshollieqilla9086 Some things may never return…
but the love and memories they leave behind still echo in us. 🤍
Thank you for sharing your heart here.
